# =============================================================================
# ECE260B Final Project - Git Ignore
# =============================================================================

# ----- Waveform files -----
*.vcd
**/waveform/

# ----- Simulation / GLS executables -----
**/sim/compiled
**/gls/compiled

# ----- Synthesis outputs -----
**/syn/work/
**/syn/*.svf

# ----- Design Compiler / Synopsys -----
**/alib-*/
**/command.log
**/filenames.log

# ----- Place-and-route (Innovus) -----
**/*.enc.dat/
**/pnr/**/*.enc
**/innovus.log
**/innovus.cmd

# ----- Editor / OS -----
.DS_Store
*.swp
*.swo
*~
Thumbs.db

# ----- Python -----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# ----- Misc -----
*.bak
*.tmp
*.temp
